  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fisheries Development Assistance in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment continues Australia&#x2019;s long-standing support for sustainable fisheries management and economic development in the Pacific as a founding member and partner of the Pacific Community and the Pacific Islands Forum Fisheries Agency. This investment supports the Pacific to sustainably manage their valuable ocean resources for livelihoods and economic growth, enhance regional coordination, and combat threats such as illegal, unreported and unregulated fishing.</narrative>
  </description>
